│ "studies": [{"study_index": 1, "title": "Screening for trisomy 21 with maternal age, fetal nuchal translucency and   │
│ maternal serum biochemistry at 11‐14 weeks: a regional experience from Germany", "abstract": "OBJECTIVE To examine   │
