│ and had a lower mean A‐wave peak velocity than did the normal waveforms (mean difference 3.7 cm/s; 95% CI, 0.3–7.0   │
│ cm/s; P = 0.03). In a prospective study of 10 normal fetuses we could produce a mitral gap deliberately by moving    │
