│ screening for Down syndrome", "abstract": "OBJECTIVES To map prenatal screening and diagnostic testing pathways in   │
│ Victorian pregnant women during 2003 to 2004; measure the impact of prenatal diagnostic testing uptake on the        │
│ effectiveness of prenatal screening for Down syndrome; and assess factors influencing uptake of diagnostic testing   │
