  agreeing to screening tests, parents need to be fully informed about the risks, benefits and possible consequences    
  of such a test. This includes subsequent choices for further tests they may face, and the implications of both false  
  positive and false negative screening tests (i.e. invasive diagnostic testing, and the possibility that a miscarried  
